    "turn_text": "Okay, so we'll go impeachment. How are you going to deal with that? Secondly, I want to find out your take on education, college education, and eliminating the debt or making it free for everyone, like Elizabeth Warren has said. Healthcare. And then something that's very dear to me is immigration with the travel ban and these countries that are on the travel ban. How do we get rid of that? Do you support it? Do you not support it? What are your thoughts on that? And also the immigration that's happening at the border.",
