    "turn_text": "Healthcare. We're working our way back. So healthcare, I believe we do need some public option. I've been a single payer person since 2007. I think the natural next step is that some kind of public option where every American can buy in to get affordable healthcare. and accessible quality healthcare. And if you can't pay for it, we should all collectively make sure you can because we want kids in our sons and daughters classes to make sure they have healthcare. We want everybody in America to have healthcare. We should be able to do that. The more important, not more important, but the other conversation that we need to have is that we have a system that's a disease care system now.",
